---
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---
<section id="late" class="late-callout">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Landing late?</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Many US flights into UIO arrive around 11:30pm</h2>
    <p>
      That's when you're tired, the hall is thin, and taxi haggling is the last thing you want.
      We don't compete with street taxis on price — you pay a prepaid premium for a licensed driver
      waiting with your name, the SUV door held open, and a flat USD rate already settled.
    </p>
    <div class="late-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href={u('/guide/arriving-quito-airport-late-at-night')}>Why prepaid is worth it after dark</a>
      <a class="btn btn-amber" href={u('/#book')}>Book your transfer</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
